.TH CHERRYTREE-DOCMODEL "1" "September 2022" "cherrytree-docmodel 0.99.49"
.SH NAME
cherrytree-docmodel \- a hierarchical note taking application
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcherrytree-docmodel [\-V] [\-N] [filepath [\-n nodename] [\-a anchorname] [\-x export_to_html_dir] [\-t export_to_txt_dir] [\-p export_to_pdf_path] [\-P password] [\-w] [\-s]]\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBcherrytree-docmodel\fP is a hierarchical note taking application, featuring rich
text, syntax highlighting, images handling, hyperlinks, import/export with
support for multiple formats, support for multiple languages, and more.
.SH AUTHOR
\fBcherrytree-docmodel\fP was written by Giuseppe Penone <giuspen@gmail.com> and Evgenii Gurianov <https://github.com/txe>.
